+## Authentication & roles
+
+Requests must include `Authorization: Bearer <key>`, matching an entry in `apiKeys` (`[{ "key", "name", "role" }]`). Missing or unknown keys return `401` (`unauthorized`); insufficient role permissions return `403` (`forbidden`).
+
+- `viewer`: `GET` routes except `/audit`.
+- `cook`: `viewer` plus cooking recipes, recording waste, logging temperatures, and entering stock-take counts.
+- `manager`: all routes including `GET /audit`.
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
